Description: Recover sensor frame numbers after V4L2 sequence normalization
 V4L2VideoDevice subtracts the first captured frame number from buffer
 metadata. Restore that offset when looking up controls against SOF events,
 including streams that skip frames before the first captured buffer.
Forwarded: no

diff --git a/include/libcamera/internal/v4l2_videodevice.h b/include/libcamera/internal/v4l2_videodevice.h
